{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24774","headline":"宿张云举院 · 白居易","name":"宿张云举院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不食胡麻饭，杯中自得仙。\n隔房招好客，可室致芳筵。\n美酝香醪嫩，时新异果鲜。\n夜深唯畏晓，坐稳不思眠。\n棊罢嫌无敌，诗成媿在前。\n明朝题壁上，谁得衆人传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}